data/raw/*
*.par
*.tim
*.npz
*.hdf5
*.h5
# …but DO keep the tiny derived position CSV (provenance for the shipped pulsar JSON,
# so nothing depends on an external path — see DATA-SOURCES.md §2).
!data/raw/nanograv_15yr_67pulsars_positions.csv
# NOTE: the shipped, derived JSON in src/data/ IS committed — see DATA-SOURCES.md.

